#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:10
msgid "Storage, logging and diagnostic services"
msgstr "存储、日志与诊断服务"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:12
msgid ""
"Services consume explicit storage or memory ports and caller-owned state. "
"Products own namespaces, persistence policy, Flash regions, migration and "
"recovery; the platform does not choose those policies."
msgstr "服务使用显式存储或内存端口及调用者拥有的状态。产品负责命名空间、持久化策略、Flash 区域、迁移和恢复；平台不替产品选择这些策略。"

