#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:27
msgid ""
"FlashDB, LittleFS and FatFs compile their locked dependency only after "
"explicit selection. Public APIs keep supplier state private in caller-sized "
"workspaces; query the required bytes and alignment for the actual linked "
"profile. FlashDB and FatFs consumers supply their operation getter in the "
"same external serialization domain and keep its exact scope live for the "
"complete call. Do not renew a finite absolute deadline for each vendor "
"callback."
msgstr ""
"FlashDB、LittleFS 和 FatFs 仅在显式选择后编译各自锁定依赖。公共 API "
"将供应商状态保存在调用方按实际大小提供的私有工作区中；须查询实际链接 profile 所需的字节数和对齐。FlashDB 与 FatFs "
"消费者须在同一外部串行化域提供 operation getter，并让其精确作用域在整个调用期间保持有效。不得为每次供应商回调续期有限绝对截止时间。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:34
msgid ""
"LittleFS and FatFs also provide bounded `read_at` and `append` operations. A"
" caller can process a file through fixed-size chunks without loading the "
"whole file or retaining an open handle. Argument/admission rejection "
"preserves the input byte count; an admitted call reports the confirmed "
"prefix, including on error. EOF is SUCCESS with zero bytes, while a starting"
" offset beyond EOF is rejected. `append` syncs and closes under the original"
" operation deadline."
msgstr ""
"LittleFS 与 FatFs 还提供有界 `read_at` 和 "
"`append`。调用者可用固定大小的分片处理文件，无需装入完整文件或保留打开的句柄。参数／准入拒绝保持输入字节数；准入后即使出错，也报告已确认前缀。EOF"
" 为 SUCCESS 且零字节；起始 offset 超过 EOF 则拒绝。`append` 在原操作 deadline 内同步并关闭。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:41
msgid ""
"A failed append's prefix is not a durable commit or permission to replay: "
"media effects may exceed that prefix. FatFs close failure faults the "
"instance and rejects new file operations; keep the same volume, operation "
"scope and workspace through explicit unmount/recovery. An unmount error "
"retains that responsibility. Neither adapter creates a VFS, global file-"
"handle pool or background writer. Durable queues, acknowledgements and "
"truncation/retention policy remain in the product."
msgstr ""
"追加失败时的前缀不代表耐久提交或允许重放：介质效果可能超过该前缀。FatFs close 失败会将实例标为故障并拒绝新文件操作；在显式 "
"unmount／恢复期间保持同一 volume、操作 scope 和 workspace。unmount 出错继续保留责任。两个 adapter "
"都不创建 VFS、全局文件句柄池或后台 writer。耐久队列、确认以及截断／retention 策略仍归产品。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:49
msgid ""
"Mount/open failure never authorizes formatting. LittleFS and FatFs format "
"only through explicit destructive calls. FlashDB existing-only preserves "
"erased or unknown media; create-if-erased is restricted to a wholly erased "
"selected region. Keep regions disjoint from each other and from the "
"product's OTA layout. Mixed erase geometry and ECC/fresh-erase requirements "
"must match the selected adapter; do not infer compatibility from byte "
"capacity alone."
msgstr ""
"mount/open 失败从不授权格式化。LittleFS 和 FatFs 仅通过显式破坏性调用格式化。FlashDB existing-only "
"保留已擦除或未知介质；create-if-erased 仅允许用于整个选定区域均已擦除的情形。各区域之间及与产品 OTA "
"布局必须互不重叠。混合擦除几何及 ECC／全新擦除要求必须匹配选定适配器；不能仅凭字节容量推断兼容性。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:56
msgid ""
"Modification failures may leave real effects. Preserve the physical owner, "
"complete its recovery, then reopen/remount the logical store as its contract"
" requires. Recovery neither replays a write nor upgrades its original "
"result. `persistent_record.h` adds explicit schema/ID/CRC framing, without "
"authentication or reliable delivery: remote ACK, deduplication, retention "
"and backpressure remain product responsibilities. See the "
"[FlashDB](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/services/flashdb/README.md), "
"[LittleFS](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/services/littlefs/README.md) and "
"[FatFs](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/services/fatfs/README.md) contracts for the exact "
"profiles. Native reopen checks do not establish physical power-loss "
"endurance."
msgstr ""
"修改失败可能已经产生实际效果。保留物理 "
"owner，完成其恢复，再按合同重新打开／挂载逻辑存储。恢复不重放写入，也不提升原结果。`persistent_record.h` 增加显式 "
"schema/ID/CRC 成帧，不提供认证或可靠交付；远端 ACK、去重、保留和背压仍由产品负责。精确 profile 见 "
"[FlashDB](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/services/flashdb/README.md)、[LittleFS](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/services/littlefs/README.md) 和 "
"[FatFs](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/services/fatfs/README.md) 合同。Native 重新打开检查不建立物理掉电耐久资格。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:66
msgid "Publish and drain ordinary logs"
msgstr "发布并排空普通日志"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:68
msgid ""
"`Nexus::Log` accepts a bounded synchronous caller-byte sink. Optional "
"`Nexus::LogFormatter` uses exclusive caller scratch and publishes only a "
"complete admitted record. `Nexus::LogUART` copies one record into caller "
"staging, then the existing UART executes it asynchronously. Log write "
"SUCCESS means copied admission in this composition; keep adapter, request "
"and staging alive until acquire-observed SETTLED. Continue explicit service "
"during failed cancellation. Stopping the adapter does not stop shared UART "
"RX or its hardware owner."
msgstr ""
"`Nexus::Log` 接受有界同步调用方字节 sink。可选 `Nexus::LogFormatter` 使用独占调用方 "
"scratch，仅发布完整且准入的记录。`Nexus::LogUART` 将一条记录复制到调用方 staging，再由已有 UART "
"异步执行。在此组合中，Log write SUCCESS 表示副本获准入；适配器、request 和 staging 须保持存活，直到 acquire "
"观察到 SETTLED。取消失败时继续显式 service。停止适配器不停止共享 UART RX 或其硬件 owner。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:76
msgid ""
"Selected `Nexus::RTT` uses caller up/down rings and whole-record nonblocking"
" SKIP behavior. No debugger or a full ring must not become an unbounded "
"wait; host consumption is neither durable capture nor physical completion. "
"UART staging may be reclaimed after request settlement and publisher join. "
"RTT stop closes local admission; its control block still references the ring"
" and name storage, which must remain valid for the image/debugger lifetime. "
"Log, UART logging, RTT and Shell are ordinary task-context paths, not "
"exception printing facilities."
msgstr ""
"选定 `Nexus::RTT` 使用调用者 up／down ring 和完整记录的非阻塞 SKIP 行为。没有 debugger 或 ring "
"已满都不得变为无限等待；host 消费既不表示持久捕获，也不表示物理完成。UART staging 可在请求结清且 publisher 已 join "
"后回收。RTT stop 关闭本地准入，但其 control block 仍引用 ring 和 name 存储，这些存储必须在 "
"image／debugger 的整个存活期保持有效。Log、UART logging、RTT 和 Shell 都是普通 task "
"上下文路径，不是异常打印设施。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:85
msgid "Observe health and retain faults"
msgstr "观察健康状态并保留故障"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:87
msgid ""
"`Nexus::Health` classifies copied progress and I/O facts. Missing facts "
"remain unknown, and zero findings grants no watchdog-feed permission. "
"Resource observations require the original quiescent painted stack "
"allocation; free paint is not a measured peak stack guarantee. "
"`Nexus::HealthFreeRTOS` exists only in the selected FreeRTOS trace profile "
"and retains its existing privilege, quiescence and task-lifetime "
"preconditions. `Nexus::DiagnosticLog` drains at most one ordinary numeric "
"event per call and retains it on failed publication."
msgstr ""
"`Nexus::Health` 对复制的进展和 I/O 事实分类。缺失事实保持 unknown，零发现不授予喂 watchdog "
"权限。资源观察要求原始已静默、已涂色的栈分配；未使用涂色区域不是已测得峰值栈用量的保证。`Nexus::HealthFreeRTOS` 仅存在于选定 "
"FreeRTOS trace profile，保留其原有特权、静默和任务存活期前提。`Nexus::DiagnosticLog` "
"每次最多排空一个普通数值事件，发布失败时保留该事件。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:95
msgid ""
"`Nexus::Fault` captures a fixed raw record into application-reserved "
"retained memory, without Log, kernel, Flash or transport calls. The F407 "
"Cortex-M4F frame helper uses explicit original stack bounds, never private "
"TCB offsets. Optional `Nexus::CmBacktrace` scans a proven still-live same-"
"boot stack after raw capture; reset does not preserve that stack's contents."
" `Nexus::FaultStorage` persists a validated record only in normal context "
"after Storage is ready, and acknowledges the retained source only after "
"successful save. Keep ambiguous failed commits for product duplicate "
"handling."
msgstr ""
"`Nexus::Fault` 将固定原始记录捕获到应用预留的保留内存中，不调用 Log、kernel、Flash 或 transport。F407 "
"Cortex-M4F frame helper 使用显式原始栈边界，从不使用私有 TCB 偏移。可选 `Nexus::CmBacktrace` "
"在原始捕获后扫描已证明仍存活的同次启动栈；reset 不保留该栈内容。`Nexus::FaultStorage` 仅在 Storage "
"就绪后的普通上下文持久化已校验记录，并只在保存成功后确认保留源。含糊的失败提交须留给产品处理重复项。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:104
msgid ""
"Selected `Nexus::Shell` exposes read-only diagnostic commands through a "
"caller transport and one task executor. `Nexus::ShellStorage` exposes the "
"exact pinned supplier layout only at composition. Shell shutdown does not "
"shut down that transport. Retention across chip reset, fault-entry "
"reliability, stack timing and all physical storage/debugger behavior remain "
"`not_executed` unless their exact hardware scope has separately executed."
msgstr ""
"选定 `Nexus::Shell` 通过调用方 transport 和一个 task executor "
"提供只读诊断命令。`Nexus::ShellStorage` 仅在组合处公开精确锁定的供应商布局。关闭 Shell 不关闭 transport。跨芯片 "
"reset 的保留、fault 入口可靠性、栈时序及所有物理存储／debugger 行为均保持 "
"`not_executed`，除非其精确硬件范围已另行实际执行。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:111
msgid "Decode a retained record on the host"
msgstr "在主机解码保留记录"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:113
msgid ""
"From the full platform checkout root, provide the captured `retained.bin`, "
"its exact firmware ELF and the selected ARM toolchain's `addr2line`:"
msgstr "在完整平台检出根目录，提供捕获的 `retained.bin`、其精确固件 ELF 及选定 ARM 工具链的 `addr2line`："

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:121
msgid ""
"The current symbolization profile accepts F407 ARM ELF32 little-endian "
"images. The application must embed a per-build unique 16-byte constant "
"symbol named `nx_fault_build_id` in the firmware and copy those exact bytes "
"into the captured record. The decoder resolves the valid recorded PC/LR only"
" after matching that ELF constant; a wrong ID or malformed record is "
"rejected with a nonzero exit. CRC and this opaque build ID are "
"integrity/identity checks, not authentication."
msgstr ""
"当前符号化 profile 接受 F407 ARM ELF32 little-endian 镜像。应用必须在固件中嵌入名为 "
"`nx_fault_build_id`、每次构建唯一的 16-byte 常量符号，并将完全相同的字节复制到捕获记录。decoder 只有匹配该 ELF "
"常量后才解析有效记录中的 PC/LR；ID 错误或记录畸形时以非零退出码拒绝。CRC 和这个不透明 build ID 用于完整性／身份检查，不提供认证。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:128
msgid ""
"Without `--elf`, the tool reports only numeric record facts. After reboot, "
"use the retained raw record and matching ELF; the old stack allocation is "
"not a still-live same-boot stack for CmBacktrace. Host symbolization does "
"not establish physical retention, a reliable exception-entry path or the "
"cause of a fault."
msgstr ""
"不带 `--elf` 时，工具只报告数值记录事实。重启后使用保留的原始记录及匹配 ELF；旧栈分配不再是供 CmBacktrace "
"使用的仍存活同次启动栈。主机符号化不证明物理保留、可靠异常入口路径或故障原因。"

