msgid "Defines"
msgstr "宏定义"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid "Load one exact schema or stage an empty, uncommitted image."
msgstr "加载精确 schema，或暂存空的未提交镜像。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid ""
"Synchronous task-only scan. Missing blob stages an empty image, without "
"reading defaults or writing Flash. Different schema/format is UNSUPPORTED "
"and never rewritten. Truncated, duplicate or unordered keys are CORRUPT. A "
"failed load never becomes an empty writable store; the instance stays "
"closed."
msgstr ""
"仅任务上下文同步扫描。缺少 blob 时暂存空镜像，不读取默认值或写 Flash。不同 schema/format 返回 "
"UNSUPPORTED，绝不重写。截断、重复或无序 key 返回 CORRUPT。加载失败不能变成空的可写存储；实例保持关闭。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid "[out] Unused or closed instance, exclusively owned"
msgstr "[out] 未使用或已关闭的独占实例"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid ""
"[inout] Open durable store; no other mutating client while this settings "
"instance is open"
msgstr "[inout] 已打开的持久化存储；Settings 打开期间不得有其他变更性客户端"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid "[in] Product-defined schema identity, including zero"
msgstr "[in] 产品定义的 schema 身份，允许零"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid ""
"[inout] Caller buffer, disjoint from both instances and the storage "
"workspace; borrowed until close or a failed commit"
msgstr "[inout] 调用者 buffer，与两个实例及 storage workspace 独立；借用至 close 或失败的 commit"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid "[in] At least HEADER_SIZE and at most UINT32_MAX"
msgstr "[in] 至少 HEADER_SIZE，至多 UINT32_MAX"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid "[in] Nonzero upper bound on staged entries"
msgstr "[in] 暂存条目数量的非零上限"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid "OK, INVALID, NO_SPACE, CORRUPT, UNSUPPORTED or port error"
msgstr "OK、INVALID、NO_SPACE、CORRUPT、UNSUPPORTED 或 port 错误"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid "Copy a staged value without exposing internal storage."
msgstr "复制暂存值，不暴露内部存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid ""
"Task-only synchronous copy; no pointer is retained. Missing key reports size"
" zero. NO_SPACE leaves output untouched and reports required bytes. No "
"underlying Flash operation occurs."
msgstr "仅任务上下文同步复制，不保留指针。缺 key 时报告长度零。NO_SPACE 保持输出不变并报告所需字节数。不执行底层 Flash 操作。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid "[in] Open instance, serialized with all mutation"
msgstr "[in] 已打开实例，与全部变更操作串行化"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid "[in] Exact product-assigned identifier"
msgstr "[in] 精确的产品分配标识"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid "[out] Disjoint destination, or NULL to query size only"
msgstr "[out] 独立目标，或以 NULL 只查询长度"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid ""
"[inout] Capacity on input, required/value bytes on output; disjoint from "
"metadata, staging image and output"
msgstr "[inout] 输入为容量，输出为所需或实际值字节数；与元数据、暂存镜像及 output 独立"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid "OK, NOT_FOUND, NO_SPACE or INVALID"
msgstr "OK、NOT_FOUND、NO_SPACE 或 INVALID"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid "Insert or replace one copied value in bounded RAM staging."
msgstr "在有界 RAM 暂存中插入或替换复制的值。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid ""
"Task-only, bounded by image capacity and entry limit. Failed admission "
"changes neither entries nor dirty state. A changed value marks staging dirty"
" without touching Flash; an identical value preserves both image and the "
"previous dirty state."
msgstr ""
"仅任务上下文，由镜像容量和条目上限约束。准入失败不改变条目或 dirty 状态。值变化使暂存变脏，不写 Flash；值相同时保留镜像和原 dirty "
"状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid "[inout] Open exclusively owned instance"
msgstr "[inout] 已打开且独占拥有的实例"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid ""
"[in] Input disjoint from instance and staging image; NULL only for an empty "
"value, borrowed during this call"
msgstr "[in] 输入与实例及暂存镜像独立；仅空值允许 NULL，调用期间借用"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid "[in] Value byte count, at most UINT32_MAX"
msgstr "[in] 值字节数，至多 UINT32_MAX"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid "OK, NO_SPACE or INVALID"
msgstr "OK、NO_SPACE 或 INVALID"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid "Remove a staged key without writing Flash."
msgstr "移除暂存 key，不写 Flash。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid ""
"Task-only synchronous operation. Missing keys have no effects. Success "
"compacts staging and marks it dirty."
msgstr "仅任务上下文同步操作。缺 key 时无影响。成功时压紧暂存并标记 dirty。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid "OK, NOT_FOUND or INVALID"
msgstr "OK、NOT_FOUND 或 INVALID"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid "Commit the complete staged snapshot through durable Storage."
msgstr "通过持久化 Storage 提交完整暂存快照。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid ""
"Task-only settled call; underlying Flash may stall execution. Clean staging "
"does not write. Successful save clears dirty. A mutating I/O failure closes "
"the instance and preserves the dirty flag for diagnosis, but retains no "
"staging borrow. Reopen Storage, then Settings to determine the surviving "
"commit; failure may occur after a new marker became durable. Retrying a "
"failed commit without recovery is rejected."
msgstr ""
"仅任务上下文同步完成调用；底层 Flash 可能暂停执行。干净暂存不写入，保存成功清除 dirty。变更性 I/O 失败会关闭实例并保留 dirty "
"供诊断，不再借用暂存。先重新打开 Storage，再打开 Settings 以确定保留的提交；失败可能发生在新 marker "
"已持久化之后。不恢复就重试失败 commit 会被拒绝。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid "OK or underlying storage error"
msgstr "OK 或底层 storage 错误"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid "Release settings metadata without committing staged values."
msgstr "释放 Settings 元数据，不提交暂存值。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid ""
"Task-only, serialized after all calls. No I/O or retained references remain."
" Underlying Storage stays open; its scratch lifetime remains governed by the"
" Storage contract."
msgstr ""
"仅任务上下文，在全部调用之后串行化。不执行 I/O，也无保留引用。底层 Storage 保持打开；其 scratch 生命周期仍由 Storage "
"合同决定。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid "[inout] Quiesced instance, or NULL"
msgstr "[inout] 已静默的实例，或 NULL"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid "Caller-owned settings metadata and bounded staging image."
msgstr "调用者拥有的 Settings 元数据与有界暂存镜像。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:155
msgid ""
"Task-only; serialize all operations and the underlying storage. No heap, "
"workers or global key registry. Keys are product-assigned uint32 "
"identifiers; values are byte strings, including empty strings. The format is"
" little-endian, not authenticated. Products own defaults, schema migration, "
"authorization, durability frequency and Flash reservations. Only commit "
"writes storage; close discards staged changes."
msgstr ""
"仅任务上下文；全部操作及底层存储须串行化。无 heap、worker 或全局 key 注册表。Key 为产品分配的 uint32 "
"标识，值为字节串，允许空串。格式为 little-endian，不提供认证。产品拥有默认值、schema 迁移、授权、持久化频率和 Flash "
"预留。只有 commit 写存储；close 丢弃暂存变更。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:159
msgid "storage.h"
msgstr "storage.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid "Two-bank durable blob storage over an explicit narrow port."
msgstr "使用显式窄端口的双 bank 持久 blob 存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid "Storage errors expose retry/reopen/recovery decisions."
msgstr "存储错误显式暴露重试／重开／恢复决策。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid "Open/recover two externally supplied uniform erase banks."
msgstr "打开／恢复两个外部供给、擦除粒度统一的 bank。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid ""
"Task-only bounded scan over both bank payloads. Workspace remains borrowed "
"by the instance through every subsequent load/save call."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文，对两个 bank 的载荷执行有界扫描。工作区由实例持续借用，覆盖此后每次 load/save 调用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid "[out] Unused or quiesced instance, no concurrent calls"
msgstr "[out] 尚未使用或已静默的实例，不存在并发调用"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid "[in] Persistent settled port, may be storage's existing port"
msgstr "[in] 返回前已结清的持久化接口，可以是存储对象原有的接口"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid "[in] Erase-aligned start within port region"
msgstr "[in] 接口区域内按擦除粒度对齐的起点"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid "[in] Each bank's erase-aligned byte size"
msgstr "[in] 每个 bank 按擦除粒度对齐的字节数"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid "[in] Caller buffer, disjoint from instance/payload"
msgstr "[in] 调用者缓冲，与实例及载荷不重叠"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid "[in] At least max(32, port.program_size)"
msgstr "[in] 至少为 max(32, port.program_size)"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid ""
"OK for recovered/empty store, CORRUPT for ambiguous or only invalid "
"committed generations, IO/INVALID for port/geometry failures"
msgstr "恢复成功或存储为空时为 OK；代次有歧义，或仅存在无效的已提交代次时为 CORRUPT；接口或几何错误时为 IO/INVALID"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid "Load and validate the latest committed whole blob."
msgstr "加载并验证最新提交的完整 blob。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid ""
"Output bytes valid only on OK; failure may partially write output. No "
"destination pointer is retained after returning."
msgstr "只有 OK 时输出字节才有效；失败时可能已部分写入输出。返回后不保留目标指针。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid "[inout] Open instance, exclusively owned for this call"
msgstr "[inout] 已打开的实例，本次调用期间独占拥有"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid "[out] Destination; NULL requests only required size"
msgstr "[out] 目标；NULL 表示只查询所需大小"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid "[inout] Input capacity, output payload/required bytes"
msgstr "[inout] 输入为容量，输出为载荷字节数或所需字节数"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid "OK, NOT_FOUND, NO_SPACE, CORRUPT or IO/INVALID"
msgstr "OK、NOT_FOUND、NO_SPACE、CORRUPT 或 IO/INVALID"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid "Commit a complete blob to the inactive bank."
msgstr "将完整 blob 提交到非活动 bank。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid ""
"Marker is programmed last after sync. Failed mutation keeps the previous "
"bank and requires reopen; ambiguous marker failure can mean the new blob "
"committed. Product owns migration/authentication/recovery policy."
msgstr ""
"同步后最后编程提交标记。修改失败时保留先前的 bank，并要求重新打开；标记失败有歧义时，新 blob 可能已经提交。迁移、认证及恢复策略由产品负责。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid "[in] Payload disjoint from workspace, borrowed during call"
msgstr "[in] 与工作区不重叠的载荷，仅调用期间借用"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid "[in] Payload bytes; zero permits NULL"
msgstr "[in] 载荷字节数；为零时允许 NULL"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid "OK, NO_SPACE, INVALID or underlying port error"
msgstr "OK、NO_SPACE、INVALID 或底层接口错误"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid "Query usable blob capacity without touching hardware."
msgstr "查询可用 blob 容量，不访问硬件。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid "[in] Geometry-established instance, or NULL"
msgstr "[in] 已建立几何信息的实例，或 NULL"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid "Payload bytes per bank, or zero for invalid geometry"
msgstr "每个 bank 的载荷字节数；几何无效时为零"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid "Synchronous settled persistent Flash port."
msgstr "同步且已结清的持久 Flash 端口。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid ""
"Task-only; caller serializes every operation. Offsets are byte-relative to "
"the supplied region. program changes only 1 to 0 in complete aligned program"
" units; erase uses complete uniform erase units. sync makes earlier "
"successful writes durable. Errors can change a subset of addressed units, "
"but never retain caller buffers after returning. RAM is a model, not a "
"persistent implementation. Product owns the region/layout and power policy."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务上下文；调用者串行使用全部操作。偏移以所提供区域的起点为基准，单位为字节。program 只在完整且对齐的编程单元内将 1 改为 0；erase"
" 使用完整且均匀的擦除单元。sync 使先前成功的写入持久化。错误可能改变所寻址单元的一部分，但返回后绝不保留调用者缓冲。RAM "
"是模型，不是持久化实现。区域、布局及电源策略由产品负责。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid "Instance metadata with caller-sized workspace."
msgstr "实例元数据与调用者确定容量的工作区。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:161
msgid ""
"Two independently erasable banks commit whole blobs. No heap, global "
"registry, maximum pool or default product reservation. Wire format v1 is "
"explicit little-endian and CRC-protected, not authenticated. Keep instance, "
"port context and workspace alive through close/quiescence. A mutating I/O "
"error invalidates opened; reopen to establish which commit actually "
"survived."
msgstr ""
"两个可独立擦除的 bank 提交完整 blob。不使用堆、全局注册表、最大容量池或默认产品预留。线上格式 v1 显式采用小端和 CRC "
"保护，不提供认证。实例、接口 context 和工作区必须保持有效，直到关闭并静默。修改性 I/O 错误会使 opened "
"失效；需要重新打开，才能确定哪个提交实际保留。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:165
msgid "mapped_storage.h"
msgstr "mapped_storage.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:167
msgid "Bounded read mappings and exclusive storage requests."
msgstr "有界只读映射与独占存储请求。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:167
msgid "Read-only consumers; capability does not prove physical routing."
msgstr "只读消费者；能力声明不证明物理布线。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:167
msgid "Physical mutation, separate from read-map ownership."
msgstr "物理修改操作，与只读映射所有权分离。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:167
msgid "Prepare unborrowed caller storage without accessing payload."
msgstr "准备未被借用的调用方存储，不访问载荷。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:167
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE; no retained references on failure."
msgstr "成功返回 SUCCESS，否则返回 INVALID/STATE；失败不保留引用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:167
msgid "Query immutable geometry without starting hardware."
msgstr "查询不可变几何参数，不启动硬件。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:167
msgid "Acquire one bounded, positive read-only span on a serialized executor."
msgstr "在串行执行器上获取一个有界、长度为正的只读范围。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:167
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID/UNSUPPORTED/BUSY/EXHAUSTED/STATE, or a backend map error. "
"Failure retains no loan; partial hardware configuration can close admission "
"and require stop to retry cleanup. Live read maps exclude all "
"command/program/erase/cache/DMA writers. CPU/XIP/DMA consumers may run "
"concurrently after successful acquisition."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS、INVALID/UNSUPPORTED/BUSY/EXHAUSTED/STATE 或 backend 映射错误。失败不保留 "
"loan；部分硬件配置可能关闭准入，需要 stop 重试清理。有效的读取映射排除所有 command/program/erase/cache/DMA "
"writer。成功获取后，CPU/XIP/DMA 消费者可以并发运行。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:167
msgid "Release an exact live loan after its consumers have joined."
msgstr "消费者全部会合退出后，释放一个精确的活动借用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:167
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID/STATE, or backend unmap error retaining the loan. Task-"
"only, same serialized executor; no forced revocation or timeout release."
msgstr ""
"返回 SUCCESS、INVALID/STATE，或保留借用的后端解除映射错误。仅供任务调用，使用同一串行执行器；不强制撤销借用，也不因超时释放。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:167
msgid "Admit one exclusive PROGRAM/ERASE request with an absolute deadline."
msgstr "以绝对期限接纳一个独占 PROGRAM/ERASE 请求。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:167
msgid ""
"SUCCESS is ACCEPTED, possibly settled. Rejection retains no request or "
"payload and produces no hardware effects. No map loan may remain live. Task-"
"only serialized owner; no workers, allocation, locks or queue exist."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS 表示 "
"ACCEPTED，请求可能已经完成结算。拒绝不保留请求或载荷，也不产生硬件效果。不得仍有活动映射借用。仅供串行任务所有者使用；不创建工作线程、内存分配、锁或队列。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:167
msgid "Request cancellation by instance and nonrepeating writer epoch."
msgstr "通过实例及不重复的写入 epoch 身份请求取消。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:167
msgid ""
"SUCCESS starts/observes drain; STATE rejects stale/foreign identity. "
"Cancellation never releases storage. Continue service through drain."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示启动或观察排空；STATE 拒绝过期或属于其他实例的身份。取消从不释放存储。须继续推进，直至排空结束。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:167
msgid "Advance one bounded backend step or drain attempt without waiting."
msgstr "不等待地推进一次有界后端步骤或排空尝试。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:167
msgid ""
"Backend/IRQ/data references detach before release-publication of SETTLED, "
"which is the final request access. Failed drain is QUARANTINED; storage "
"remains borrowed and later service may retry source withdrawal."
msgstr ""
"在以 release 语义发布 SETTLED 前，后端、IRQ 和数据引用全部脱离；该发布是对请求的最后访问。排空失败进入 "
"QUARANTINED；存储继续被借用，后续推进可以重试撤回访问源。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:167
msgid "Close admission and request writer cancellation."
msgstr "关闭准入并请求取消写入操作。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:167
msgid ""
"SUCCESS only after all map loans, writer sources and partial map cleanup are"
" gone. BUSY retains storage and needs release/service; another backend "
"cleanup error retains its responsibility for stop retry. Repeated successful"
" stop performs no backend operation. This does not revoke loans or reopen "
"admission; cold restart uses the explicit owner contract."
msgstr ""
"所有映射 loan、writer 来源和部分映射清理全部退出后才返回 SUCCESS。BUSY 保留存储并需要 release/service；其他 "
"backend 清理错误保留相应责任，供 stop 重试。重复成功 stop 不执行 backend 操作。此操作不撤销 "
"loan，也不重新开放准入；冷重启遵守显式 owner 合同。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:167
msgid "Exact byte geometry; units divide size and one another."
msgstr "精确字节几何参数；各单位须整除总大小，且彼此满足整除关系。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:167
msgid "Caller-owned request and input, borrowed through SETTLED."
msgstr "调用方拥有的请求及输入，保持被借用至 SETTLED。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:167
msgid ""
"Initialize base before prepare. PROGRAM borrows length input bytes; ERASE "
"requires NULL input. Geometry alignment is checked at admission. Partial "
"effects survive cancellation, timeout and I/O failure. No replay."
msgstr ""
"准备前先初始化 base。PROGRAM 借用 length 个输入字节；ERASE 要求输入为 NULL。几何对齐在准入时检查。取消、超时或 I/O "
"失败都不会撤销已产生的部分效果。不得重放。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:167
msgid "Stable instance-bound identity of one read mapping."
msgstr "一个只读映射的稳定实例绑定身份。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:167
msgid ""
"Fields are immutable until release. Data stays read-only. Join every CPU, "
"XIP instruction fetch and DMA reader before release; a copied token grants "
"no additional loan. A failed release retains cleanup responsibility; readers"
" remain joined and must not resume access through the view. The portable "
"owner closes admission and permits release/stop cleanup retry."
msgstr ""
"字段在 release 前不可变。数据保持只读。Release 前须 join 每个 CPU、XIP 指令取指和 DMA 读取者；复制 token "
"不授予额外借用。Release 失败会保留清理责任；读取者必须保持已 join，不得通过该 view 恢复访问。可移植 owner 关闭准入，并允许重试"
" release/stop 清理。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:167
msgid "Stable writer identity; drain controls before reuse or destruction."
msgstr "稳定的写入身份；复用或销毁前须排空控制请求。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:167
msgid "Shared immutable operations; every callback receives instance state."
msgstr "共享不可变操作表；每个回调都接收实例状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:167
msgid "Immutable face; context and all retained storage outlive users."
msgstr "不可变接口对象；上下文及全部保留存储必须比使用者存活更久。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:171
msgid "mapped_storage_owner.h"
msgstr "mapped_storage_owner.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:173
msgid "Explicit portable mapped-storage constructor and storage."
msgstr "显式、可移植的映射存储构造器及存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:173
msgid "Bind unused explicit storage without hardware or payload access."
msgstr "绑定未使用的显式存储，不访问硬件或载荷。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:173
msgid ""
"SUCCESS or INVALID; zero capacity, overlapping metadata/aperture, "
"overflowing spans, inconsistent units and missing callbacks reject. Caller "
"constructs a const face with owner_ops and this owner context."
msgstr ""
"返回 SUCCESS 或 INVALID；容量为零、元数据与映射窗口重叠、跨度溢出、单位不一致或缺少回调时拒绝。调用方使用 owner_ops "
"和此所有者上下文构造 const 接口对象。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:173
msgid "Reopen a constructed, closed and fully quiescent owner."
msgstr "重新开放已构造、关闭且完全静止的 owner。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:173
msgid ""
"SUCCESS; INVALID for missing construction; STATE if already open; BUSY while"
" a writer, reader loan or map cleanup remains. No hardware is accessed. "
"Preserve slot/free-list and writer epochs, including exhaustion. One "
"serialized executor calls this after the backend's cold restart; all "
"previous controls and consumers must already have joined. init is only for "
"unused storage and must never replace this restart operation."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS；未构造时为 INVALID；已开放时为 STATE；仍有 writer、reader loan 或映射清理时为 "
"BUSY。不访问硬件。保留 slot/free-list 和 writer epoch，包括耗尽状态。唯一串行执行者在 backend "
"冷重启后调用；原控制操作和消费者必须全部 join。init 只用于未使用的存储，绝不能替代此重启操作。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:173
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:263
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "变量"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:173
msgid "One read-only method table shared by every portable owner instance."
msgstr "全部可移植所有者实例共享的一张只读方法表。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:173
msgid "Mapping result and retained controller-cleanup responsibility."
msgstr "映射结果及保留的控制器清理责任。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:173
msgid ""
"SUCCESS requires cleanup_required. A failure with cleanup_required closes "
"admission without publishing a loan; stop retries unmap until it succeeds. A"
" failure without cleanup_required has no hardware effects."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS 必须同时设置 cleanup_required。失败且设置 cleanup_required 时关闭准入，不发布 loan；stop "
"重试 unmap，直至成功。失败且未设置 cleanup_required 时没有硬件副作用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:173
msgid ""
"Private provider boundary; immutable callbacks and independent context."
msgstr "私有提供方边界；回调不可变，上下文独立。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:173
msgid ""
"Context is one explicitly sized private state span. Geometry and mapped "
"address stay fixed. map SUCCESS establishes the readable aperture and "
"cleanup responsibility. A partial map failure retains cleanup without "
"granting any readable loan. unmap SUCCESS proves all aperture/cache "
"references withdrawn; failure retains cleanup or the last loan and closes "
"reader/writer admission. Readers remain joined after a release attempt; a "
"retained loan authorizes cleanup retry, not renewed access. start receives "
"the original absolute request deadline, only after request admission and "
"mapping exclusion. It must not restart that budget. start errors may have "
"effects and always proceed through drain. poll advances bounded work, "
"returns BUSY or a terminal result, and supplies monotonically increasing "
"completed bytes. cancel initiates withdrawal but proves no drain. drain "
"SUCCESS detaches every hardware/IRQ/cache/DMA/descriptor/data source; BUSY "
"retains ownership, other errors quarantine it. No callback retains the "
"request itself. Command/cache/DMA writers outside these callbacks are "
"forbidden while the owner exists. Physical adapters own cache-line domains, "
"XIP execution exclusion and hardware-specific drain proof."
msgstr ""
"context 是一个显式给定大小的私有状态 span。几何与映射地址固定。map SUCCESS 建立可读 aperture "
"和清理责任。部分映射失败保留清理，但不授予任何可读 loan。unmap SUCCESS 证明全部 aperture/cache "
"引用已撤回；失败则保留清理或最后一个 loan，并关闭 reader/writer 准入。release 尝试后，reader 仍保持已 "
"join；保留的 loan 只允许重试清理，不允许恢复访问。start 只在请求准入且排除映射后接收原请求的绝对 "
"deadline，不能重启预算。start 错误可能已有副作用，始终继续排空。poll 推进有界工作，返回 BUSY "
"或终止结果，并提供单调不减的完成字节数。cancel 发起撤回，但不证明排空。drain SUCCESS 撤回全部 "
"hardware/IRQ/cache/DMA/descriptor/data 来源；BUSY "
"保留所有权，其他错误进入隔离。回调均不保留请求本身。owner 存续期间，禁止在这些回调之外运行 command/cache/DMA "
"writer。物理适配器负责 cache-line 域、XIP 执行排除及硬件特定的排空证明。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:173
msgid "Exact caller-owned map capacity; fields belong to the owner."
msgstr "精确的调用方映射容量；各字段归所有者管理。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:173
msgid "Caller-owned state, published only after successful initialization."
msgstr "调用方拥有的状态，仅在初始化成功后发布。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:173
msgid ""
"All methods and controls use one serialized task executor. Consumers may use"
" their maps elsewhere, then join before release. No implicit IRQ guard or "
"cross-task synchronization is supplied. Keep state, slots, backend context, "
"clock and face alive through stop and control/consumer join."
msgstr ""
"全部方法和控制操作使用同一个串行任务执行器。消费者可以在其他执行上下文使用映射，但释放前须会合退出。不隐式提供 IRQ "
"保护或跨任务同步。状态、时隙、后端上下文、时钟和接口对象均须保持存活，直至停止及控制使用者与消费者会合退出。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:177
msgid "fal.h"
msgstr "fal.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:179
msgid "Explicit Flash-region transactions for storage consumers."
msgstr "面向存储消费者的显式 Flash 区域事务。"

