#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:197
msgid "[in] Shared finite deadline for open/write/sync/close."
msgstr "[in] open/write/sync/close 共享的有限截止时间。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:197
msgid "SUCCESS or checked error; replacement is not a multi-file transaction."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或检查所得错误；替换不是多文件事务。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:197
msgid "Read a whole file without reporting a truncated success."
msgstr "读取完整文件，不将截断报告为成功。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:197
msgid "[inout] Mounted serialized state."
msgstr "[inout] 已挂载的串行化状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:197
msgid "[in] Exact relative bounded file path."
msgstr "[in] 精确相对有界文件路径。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:197
msgid "[out] Disjoint caller output, or NULL for a size query."
msgstr "[out] 不重叠的调用方输出；查询大小时可为 NULL。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:197
msgid "[inout] Input capacity and output required file bytes."
msgstr "[inout] 输入为容量，输出为文件所需字节数。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:197
msgid "[in] Shared finite budget, never renewed by a callback."
msgstr "[in] 共享有限预算，回调不得续期。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:197
msgid "SUCCESS, EMPTY, EXHAUSTED or checked error; failure output is invalid."
msgstr "SUCCESS、EMPTY、EXHAUSTED 或检查所得错误；失败时输出无效。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:197
msgid "Read one bounded chunk without retaining a file handle or buffer."
msgstr "读取一个有界分片，不保留文件句柄或缓冲。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:197
msgid ""
"A short successful read reaches EOF. Argument/admission rejection leaves "
"bytes unchanged. After admission, bytes starts at zero; on error, bytes "
"identifies only the prefix confirmed by the vendor read, not successful "
"close or a met deadline. Other output is unspecified. Data, bytes and path "
"do not overlap each other or live adapter storage. All borrows end on "
"return; caller retains the physical owner and workspace through explicit "
"recovery/unmount. No automatic retries."
msgstr ""
"短成功读取表示到达 EOF。参数／准入拒绝保持 bytes 不变；准入后 bytes 从零开始。出错时 bytes 只表示供应商读取已确认的前缀，不证明"
" close 成功或满足 deadline。其余输出未定义。data、bytes 与 path 不得互相重叠或覆盖 live adapter "
"存储。返回即结束所有借用；物理 owner 与 workspace 仍保留至显式恢复／unmount。不自动重试。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:197
msgid "[inout] Mounted, task-only, same-owner serialized state."
msgstr "[inout] 已 mount、仅任务、同一 owner 串行化的状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:197
msgid "[in] Relative bounded path, with the same limits as get."
msgstr "[in] 有界相对路径，限制与 get 相同。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:197
msgid "[in] File byte offset, at most INT32_MAX; no sparse seek."
msgstr "[in] 文件字节 offset，最大 INT32_MAX；不作稀疏 seek。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:197
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "[out] Disjoint caller buffer for the requested capacity."
msgstr "[out] 按请求容量提供的独立调用者缓冲。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:197
msgid "[inout] Positive capacity, then upstream-confirmed prefix."
msgstr "[inout] 正容量，随后为上游确认的前缀。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:197
msgid "[in] One finite budget for open, seek, read and close."
msgstr "[in] open、seek、read 与 close 共用一个有限预算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:197
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, EMPTY, INVALID or checked error. EOF is SUCCESS with zero bytes; an"
" offset past EOF is INVALID with zero bytes."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS、EMPTY、INVALID 或已检查错误。EOF 是 SUCCESS 加零字节；offset 超过 EOF 是 INVALID "
"加零字节。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:197
msgid "Append and synchronize one bounded chunk, closing within this call."
msgstr "追加并同步一个有界分片，在本次调用内关闭。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:197
msgid ""
"Argument/admission rejection leaves bytes unchanged; admitted calls set it "
"to zero before writing. A failure may change the medium beyond this "
"confirmed prefix. Written bytes do not prove durable commit on error; do not"
" append the remainder blindly after sync/close failure. SUCCESS proves the "
"selected sync, not a multi-call transaction or physical power-loss "
"guarantee. A zero-length call creates/syncs an empty file if absent. Buffer "
"and metadata follow read_at's disjoint storage and same-owner lifetime "
"rules; no handle survives return."
msgstr ""
"参数／准入拒绝保持 bytes；准入后写入前置零。失败可能在已确认前缀之外改变介质。出错时写入字节数不证明耐久提交；sync／close "
"失败后不得盲目追加余下数据。SUCCESS 只证明选定 "
"sync，不提供跨调用事务或物理掉电保证。零长度调用会在文件不存在时创建／同步空文件。缓冲与元数据遵循 read_at 的独立存储及同一 owner "
"生命周期规则；返回后无句柄保留。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:197
msgid "[in] Relative bounded path; create the file if absent."
msgstr "[in] 有界相对路径；不存在时创建文件。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:197
msgid "[in] Disjoint immutable buffer, NULL only for zero length."
msgstr "[in] 独立不可变缓冲；只有零长度可为 NULL。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:197
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "[inout] Requested length, then vendor-confirmed written prefix."
msgstr "[inout] 请求长度，随后为供应商确认的已写前缀。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:197
msgid "[in] One finite budget for open, write, sync and close."
msgstr "[in] open、write、sync 与 close 共用一个有限预算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:197
msgid "SUCCESS, EXHAUSTED or checked error; no implicit format or retry."
msgstr "SUCCESS、EXHAUSTED 或已检查错误；不隐式格式化或重试。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:197
msgid "Private vendor state and caches live in the caller workspace."
msgstr "供应商私有状态与 cache 位于调用方工作区中。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:201
msgid "fatfs.h"
msgstr "fatfs.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "FatFs single-volume profile over an existing Block owner."
msgstr "基于既有 Block owner 的 FatFs 单卷 profile。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "Resolve the exact active volume operation for vendor disk callbacks."
msgstr "为供应商 disk 回调解析精确的活跃卷操作。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid ""
"Consumer supplies this function. No library current-device registry, "
"implicit initialization, task or lock. One FatFs volume per link profile."
msgstr "此函数由消费者提供。不使用库级当前设备注册表，不隐式初始化，也不创建任务或锁。每个链接 profile 只含一个 FatFs 卷。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "Same scope pointer passed to the current API, or NULL outside calls."
msgstr "与传入当前 API 相同的作用域指针；调用之外为 NULL。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "Exact workspace bytes, including vendor state and formatting buffer."
msgstr "精确工作区字节数，包括供应商状态与格式化 buffer。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "Required alignment for metadata and the selected Block buffer."
msgstr "metadata 和所选 Block buffer 所需对齐。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "Bind an already active writable 512-byte Block media session."
msgstr "绑定已活跃、可写的 512-byte Block 介质会话。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "No VFS, FTL, heap or second hardware owner. Long names are disabled."
msgstr "不提供 VFS、FTL、堆或第二个硬件 owner。禁用长文件名。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "[in] Stable existing Block owner, not a raw NOR Flash wrapper."
msgstr "[in] 稳定的既有 Block owner，不是原始 NOR Flash wrapper。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "[in] Ready monotonic provider-domain clock."
msgstr "[in] 已就绪、位于提供者域的单调时钟。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "[in] Product partition start in whole sectors."
msgstr "[in] 产品分区起点，以完整扇区计。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "[in] Positive product partition extent."
msgstr "[in] 正的产品分区范围。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "[inout] Disjoint aligned storage retained until unmount."
msgstr "[inout] 不重叠的对齐存储，保留到 unmount。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, STATE or UNSUPPORTED without media effects."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、STATE 或 UNSUPPORTED；不产生介质效果。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "Format only an explicitly selected unmounted volume."
msgstr "仅格式化显式选定的未挂载卷。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid ""
"Never called by mount or error recovery. FAT is not a journaled database."
msgstr "mount 或错误恢复从不调用。FAT 不是日志型数据库。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "[in] Exact active product scope and finite full-call budget."
msgstr "[in] 精确活跃产品作用域及有限整调用预算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "SUCCESS or error; destructive partial effects may remain."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或错误；可能保留部分破坏性效果。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "Mount existing FAT data without fallback formatting."
msgstr "挂载已有 FAT 数据，不回退到格式化。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "[in] Active product scope for an unmounted volume."
msgstr "[in] 未挂载卷的活跃产品作用域。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "SUCCESS or error; prior media uncertainty keeps admission closed."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或错误；此前的介质不确定性使准入保持关闭。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "Unmount after users join, retaining the existing Block owner."
msgstr "使用者退出后 unmount，保留既有 Block owner。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "[in] Active product scope for the exact selected volume."
msgstr "[in] 精确选定卷的活跃产品作用域。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "SUCCESS or error; timeout does not authorize removing media or clocks."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或错误；timeout 不授权移除介质或时钟。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "Write one short-name relative file and synchronize before return."
msgstr "写入一个相对短文件名文件，并在返回前同步。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "[in] Mounted same-owner scope with one finite deadline."
msgstr "[in] 已挂载、同 owner 的作用域，采用一个有限截止时间。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "[in] Relative 8.3 path, at most 63 bytes, without volume prefix."
msgstr "[in] 相对 8.3 路径，最多 63 bytes，不带卷前缀。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "[in] Immutable bytes borrowed until return only."
msgstr "[in] 不可变字节，仅借用到返回。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "[in] Exact length, NULL permitted only for an empty file."
msgstr "[in] 精确长度；仅空文件允许 NULL。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "SUCCESS or error; failed writes may have changed a sector prefix."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或错误；写入失败可能已改变扇区前缀。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "Copy one complete file without silently accepting a short Block read."
msgstr "复制一个完整文件，不静默接受 Block 短读。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "[in] Mounted exact active scope and finite deadline."
msgstr "[in] 已挂载的精确活跃作用域及有限截止时间。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "[in] Relative short-name path."
msgstr "[in] 相对短文件名路径。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "[out] Disjoint output, or NULL for a size query."
msgstr "[out] 不重叠输出；查询大小时可为 NULL。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "[inout] Capacity on entry, required length on success/EXHAUSTED."
msgstr "[inout] 进入时为容量，success/EXHAUSTED 时为所需长度。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "SUCCESS, EMPTY, EXHAUSTED or error; failure output is unspecified."
msgstr "SUCCESS、EMPTY、EXHAUSTED 或错误；失败时输出未指定。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "Read a bounded file chunk and close the local handle before return."
msgstr "读取有界文件分片，并在返回前关闭局部句柄。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid ""
"Short successful reads reach EOF. Argument/admission rejection leaves bytes "
"unchanged; admitted calls set it to zero. An error may follow a confirmed "
"prefix; bytes does not prove successful close or deadline compliance. Other "
"output is unspecified. Data, bytes and path do not overlap each other or "
"live adapter storage. No handle, buffer, hidden worker or lock survives "
"return; media uncertainty retains the original Block owner and workspace "
"until explicit recovery/unmount."
msgstr ""
"短成功读取表示到达 EOF。参数／准入拒绝保持 bytes；准入后置零。错误可能发生在已确认前缀之后；bytes 不证明 close 成功或满足 "
"deadline。其余输出未定义。data、bytes 与 path 不得互相重叠或覆盖 live adapter 存储。返回后不保留句柄、缓冲、隐藏 "
"worker 或 lock；介质不确定性要求保留原 Block owner 与 workspace 至显式恢复／unmount。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "[in] Mounted, task-only, same-owner scope and finite budget."
msgstr "[in] 已 mount、仅任务、同一 owner 的 scope 和有限预算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "[in] Relative short-name path, with the same limits as get."
msgstr "[in] 相对短文件名路径，限制与 get 相同。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "[in] File byte offset; seeking past EOF is rejected."
msgstr "[in] 文件字节 offset；拒绝 seek 到 EOF 之外。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "[inout] Positive capacity, then vendor-confirmed read prefix."
msgstr "[inout] 正容量，随后为供应商确认的已读前缀。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "Append and synchronize one chunk within the original operation."
msgstr "在原操作内追加并同步一个分片。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid ""
"Open, append, sync and close share the operation deadline. Rejection before "
"admission leaves bytes unchanged; admitted calls start at zero. On failure, "
"effects can exceed the confirmed prefix and this count proves no durable "
"commit or retry permission. SUCCESS establishes the selected sync, not "
"power-loss atomicity or a multi-call transaction. A zero-length call "
"creates/syncs an empty file if absent. Storage and borrow rules match "
"read_at; no file handle survives the call."
msgstr ""
"open、append、sync 与 close 共用操作 deadline。准入前拒绝保持 "
"bytes；准入后置零。失败效果可能超过已确认前缀，计数不证明耐久提交或允许重试。SUCCESS 只建立选定 "
"sync，不提供掉电原子性或跨调用事务。零长度调用会在文件不存在时创建／同步空文件。存储与借用规则同 read_at；调用后不保留文件句柄。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "[in] Mounted task-only scope, serialized with all users."
msgstr "[in] 已 mount 的仅任务 scope，与全部使用者串行化。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "[in] Relative short-name path; create the file if absent."
msgstr "[in] 相对短文件名路径；不存在时创建文件。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "[in] Disjoint immutable input, NULL only for zero length."
msgstr "[in] 独立不可变输入；只有零长度可为 NULL。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, EXHAUSTED or checked error; sync/close failure retains volume fault"
" responsibility and closes new admission."
msgstr "SUCCESS、EXHAUSTED 或已检查错误；sync／close 失败保留 volume 故障责任并关闭新准入。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "Caller-owned volume; private vendor state remains in its workspace."
msgstr "调用方拥有的卷；供应商私有状态保留在其工作区中。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:203
msgid "Immutable scope supplied by the product's same-owner serialization."
msgstr "由产品同 owner 串行化机制提供的不可变作用域。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:207
msgid "log_format.h"
msgstr "log_format.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:209
msgid "Caller-buffer formatting before log publication."
msgstr "在 Log 发布前使用调用者 buffer 格式化。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:209
msgid "Format one complete record into exclusive caller storage."
msgstr "将一条完整记录格式化到独占调用方存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:209
msgid ""
"Task-only; uses bounded allocation-free rendering. Integer, pointer, "
"character and precision-limited string conversions are admitted. "
"Width/precision are literal and at most 1024; dynamic widths, floating point"
" and n are rejected. Every string input supplies its explicit precision and "
"valid readable storage. No partial record reaches the sink. No heap, shared "
"scratch, implicit newline or worker is added."
msgstr ""
"仅限任务上下文；使用有界且无需内存分配的格式化实现。支持整数、指针、字符和精度受限的字符串转换。宽度和精度必须为字面常量，且不超过 "
"1024；拒绝动态宽度、浮点和 n "
"格式转换。每个字符串输入须提供明确精度及有效可读存储。部分记录不会到达输出端口；不增加堆分配、共享临时缓冲区、隐式换行或工作线程。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:209
msgid "[inout] Live logger, with its existing task-only contract."
msgstr "[inout] 活跃 logger，保留既有仅 task 合同。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:209
msgid "[in] Record severity."
msgstr "[in] 记录严重级别。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:209
msgid "[out] Exclusive scratch, disjoint from logger and inputs."
msgstr "[out] 独占 scratch，与 logger 和输入不重叠。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:209
msgid "[in] Positive scratch capacity, including terminating NUL."
msgstr "[in] 正 scratch 容量，包括结尾 NUL。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:209
msgid "[in] Existing sink's absolute monotonic deadline."
msgstr "[in] 既有 sink 的绝对单调截止时间。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:209
msgid "[in] Valid format terminated within 256 bytes."
msgstr "[in] 在 256 bytes 内终止的有效格式。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:209
msgid "[in] Arguments matching the admitted format."
msgstr "[in] 与准入格式匹配的参数。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:209
msgid ""
"SUCCESS or log error; INVALID for unsupported format; OVERFLOW when a "
"complete record does not fit."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或日志错误；格式不支持时为 INVALID；完整记录放不下时为 OVERFLOW。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:209
msgid "Variadic entry with the same bounds and borrow contract."
msgstr "可变参数入口，采用相同边界及借用合同。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:209
msgid "[inout] Live task-only logger."
msgstr "[inout] 活跃、仅 task 的 logger。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:209
msgid "[out] Exclusive scratch through return."
msgstr "[out] 独占 scratch，保留到返回。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:209
msgid "[in] Scratch bytes, including terminating NUL."
msgstr "[in] scratch 字节数，包括结尾 NUL。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:209
msgid "[in] Absolute sink deadline."
msgstr "[in] sink 的绝对截止时间。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:209
msgid "[in] Admitted format followed by matching arguments."
msgstr "[in] 准入格式及随后匹配的参数。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:209
msgid "Same result as nx_log_vprintf."
msgstr "与 nx_log_vprintf 返回相同结果。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:213
msgid "log_uart.h"
msgstr "log_uart.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:215
msgid "Caller-owned UART record with settled lifetime."
msgstr "调用者拥有、存活期遵循结清合同的 UART 记录。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:215
msgid "Bind one unused staging record to an existing UART owner."
msgstr "将一条未使用的 staging 记录绑定到既有 UART owner。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:215
msgid "Task-only initialization; no device initialization or I/O."
msgstr "仅 task 初始化；不初始化设备或执行 I/O。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:215
msgid "[out] Unpublished caller-owned adapter."
msgstr "[out] 未发布的调用方适配器。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:215
msgid "[in] Existing live UART face, exclusively owned for TX."
msgstr "[in] 既有活跃 UART 接口面，独占其 TX。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:215
msgid "[out] Positive caller-owned staging span, disjoint from sink."
msgstr "[out] 正长度调用方 staging 范围，与 sink 不重叠。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:215
msgid "[in] Staging bytes; each record must fit completely."
msgstr "[in] staging 字节数；每条记录必须完整放入。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:215
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID without modifying rejected storage."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID，不修改被拒绝的存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:215
msgid "Obtain the existing log sink interface over this adapter."
msgstr "取得此适配器上的既有日志 sink 接口。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:215
msgid ""
"write copies before returning; no input pointer is retained. flush services "
"once and returns BUSY until SETTLED, preserving its actual final result. No "
"wait, retry or timeout revocation."
msgstr ""
"write 返回前完成复制，不保留输入指针。flush 推进一次 service，在 SETTLED 前返回 "
"BUSY，并保留实际最终结果。不等待、不重试，也不因 timeout 撤销借用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:215
msgid "[inout] Initialized adapter kept alive through drain."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的适配器，须存活到排空结束。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:215
msgid "Synchronous caller-byte interface; NULL produces empty port."
msgstr "同步调用方字节接口；NULL 产生空端口。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:215
msgid "Advance the actual UART once and observe final settlement."
msgstr "推进真实 UART 一次，并观察最终结清。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:215
msgid ""
"No staging reuse before acquire-observed SETTLED. This call does not stop "
"shared UART RX or release hardware ownership."
msgstr "acquire 观察到 SETTLED 前不得复用 staging。此调用不停止共享 UART RX，也不释放硬件所有权。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:215
msgid "[inout] Same unique task executor as write/flush/stop."
msgstr "[inout] 与 write/flush/stop 相同的唯一 task executor。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:215
msgid ""
"BUSY while borrowed; otherwise final transfer result or SUCCESS when idle. A"
" short successful transfer is reported as IO."
msgstr "借用期间为 BUSY；否则返回最终传输结果，空闲时为 SUCCESS。短传输成功会报告为 IO。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:215
msgid "Close admission and request cancellation without reclaiming."
msgstr "关闭准入并请求取消，不回收存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:215
msgid ""
"Continue service after BUSY or failed drain. Adapter and staging storage "
"remain live through settlement and publisher join. This does not call "
"nx_uart_port_stop."
msgstr ""
"BUSY 或排空失败后继续 service。适配器与 staging 存储须保持存活到结清及发布者退出会合。此操作不调用 "
"nx_uart_port_stop。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:215
msgid "[inout] Unique executor; future log publishers are joining."
msgstr "[inout] 唯一 executor；后续日志发布者正退出会合。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:215
msgid "SUCCESS when idle, BUSY while drain remains, or cancel error."
msgstr "空闲时为 SUCCESS，仍待排空时为 BUSY，或返回取消错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:215
msgid "Explicit one-record staging, with no default queue or worker."
msgstr "显式单记录 staging，没有默认队列或 worker。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:215
msgid ""
"One task executor owns all sink, service and stop calls and exclusively owns"
" UART TX. RX remains with its declared owner. Buffer/adapter/port survive "
"through SETTLED even on timeout or failed cancellation. SUCCESS from write "
"means admission of a private copy, not physical completion. Statistics "
"saturate."
msgstr ""
"一个 task executor 拥有全部 sink、service 和 stop 调用，并独占 UART TX。RX 仍由其声明的 owner "
"负责。即使 timeout 或取消失败，buffer/adapter/port 也须存活到 SETTLED。write 的 SUCCESS "
"表示私有副本获准入，不是物理完成。统计计数饱和。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:219
msgid "health.h"
msgstr "health.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:221
msgid "Copied health facts and explicit progress budgets."
msgstr "复制的健康事实与显式进展预算。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:221
msgid "Publish one explicit progress occurrence with no clock read."
msgstr "发布一次显式进展，不读时钟。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:221
msgid ""
"Bounded task/IRQ arithmetic; does not imply useful work or grant watchdog "
"feed/recovery permission."
msgstr "有界 task/IRQ 运算；不表示有效工作，也不授予喂 watchdog 或恢复权限。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:221
msgid "[inout] Exclusive caller state; initially zeroed."
msgstr "[inout] 独占调用方状态；初始清零。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:221
msgid "[in] Finite monotonic observation in the owner's one domain."
msgstr "[in] owner 唯一域中的有限单调观察值。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:221
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, STATE on reversed time, EXHAUSTED on generation exhaustion, or "
"INVALID; rejection preserves state."
msgstr "SUCCESS；时间回退为 STATE，generation 耗尽为 EXHAUSTED，或 INVALID；拒绝时保留状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:221
msgid "Classify supplied stable copies without sampling any device."
msgstr "对提供的稳定副本分类，不采样任何设备。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:221
msgid ""
"Task/IRQ fixed work, no clock, MMIO, service, kernel, heap, global registry,"
" automatic feed/reset or hidden worker."
msgstr ""
"task/IRQ 固定工作量，不读时钟、不访问 MMIO，不执行 service、kernel、堆、全局注册、自动 feed/reset 或隐藏 "
"worker。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:221
msgid "[in] Stable nonoverlapping values; missing groups unknown."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且不重叠的值；缺失组保持 unknown。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:221
msgid "[out] Separate destination, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 分离目标，拒绝时不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:221
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, or STATE for reversed known progress time."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID，或已知进展时间回退时的 STATE。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:221
msgid "Caller-owned progress state; its owner serializes update and copy."
msgstr "调用方拥有的进展状态；其 owner 串行化更新与复制。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:221
msgid "Stable same-domain copies, without retained live device references."
msgstr "同域稳定副本，不保留活跃设备引用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:221
msgid "Independent known groups, observations and source freshness."
msgstr "独立的已知组、观察值及来源新鲜度。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:221
msgid ""
"Zero findings is not a health certificate or feed permission. IO "
"unknown_facts remains the original diagnostic value."
msgstr "零发现不是健康证书，也不授予 feed 权限。IO unknown_facts 保持原始诊断值。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:225
msgid "health_resources.h"
msgstr "health_resources.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:227
msgid "Quiescent stack and ordinary ring resource facts."
msgstr "无并发写入的堆栈与普通环形缓冲区资源事实。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:227
msgid "Sample one original quiescent painted span and optional ring."
msgstr "采样一个原始已静默涂色范围及可选 ring。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:227
msgid ""
"Same quiescence/provenance contract as nx_stack_observe; excludes current "
"SP, live frames and exception reservation. At most bytes reads and one ring "
"count query, no suspension, live painting, kernel enumeration, transport or "
"allocation. The caller serializes output and input lifetime. Task-only; "
"optional ring retains its privileged single-CPU domain."
msgstr ""
"与 nx_stack_observe 采用相同静默／来源合同；排除当前 SP、活跃栈帧及异常预留。最多读取 bytes 个字节并查询一次 ring "
"计数，不暂停任务、不对活栈涂色，不枚举 kernel，不传输或分配内存。调用方串行化输出并负责输入存活期。仅 task；可选 ring 保留其特权单 "
"CPU 域。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:227
msgid "[in] Original paint-provenance span, or NULL for unknown."
msgstr "[in] 具有原始涂色来源的范围；未知时为 NULL。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:227
msgid "[in] Original positive capacity; zero when stack is NULL."
msgstr "[in] 原始正容量；stack 为 NULL 时为零。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:227
msgid "[in] Exact byte used before any frame became live."
msgstr "[in] 任何栈帧活跃前使用的精确字节。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:227
msgid "[in] Existing live ordinary ring, or NULL for unknown."
msgstr "[in] 既有活跃普通 ring；未知时为 NULL。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:227
msgid "[out] Separate result; unchanged on any rejection."
msgstr "[out] 分离结果；任何拒绝时均不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:227
msgid "SUCCESS or actual stack/ring INVALID/CONTEXT error."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或实际栈／ring 的 INVALID/CONTEXT 错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:227
msgid "Stack paint is not peak usage; ring loss is not a completion count."
msgstr "栈涂色不代表峰值用量；ring 丢失不代表完成次数。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:231
msgid "health_freertos.h"
msgstr "health_freertos.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:233
msgid "Resources from original static FreeRTOS tasks."
msgstr "来自原始静态 FreeRTOS task 的资源。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:233
msgid "Sample one exact original static-task allocation, not a TCB walk."
msgstr "采样一个精确原始静态任务分配，不遍历 TCB。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:233
msgid ""
"Available only in an explicitly selected FreeRTOS trace profile. All "
"nx_freertos_stack_observe running, privileged, unmasked, quiescent-stack and"
" no-delete/join preconditions apply. This adapter creates no task, performs "
"no suspension, does not query private offsets and is never used on fault."
msgstr ""
"仅显式选定 FreeRTOS trace profile 可用。适用 nx_freertos_stack_observe "
"的全部运行、特权、未屏蔽、静默栈及禁止删除／退出会合前提。此适配器不创建任务、不暂停任务、不查询私有偏移，也从不用于 fault。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:233
msgid "[in] Existing quiescent task binding, or NULL for unknown."
msgstr "[in] 既有已静默 task 绑定；未知时为 NULL。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:233
msgid "[in] Existing ordinary ring, or NULL for unknown."
msgstr "[in] 既有普通 ring；未知时为 NULL。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:233
msgid "[out] Independent result, unchanged on failure."
msgstr "[out] 独立结果，失败时不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:233
msgid "SUCCESS or the existing observation/ring error."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或既有观察／ring 错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:237
msgid "diagnostic_log.h"
msgstr "diagnostic_log.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:239
msgid "One retained ordinary diagnostic event for Log."
msgstr "为 Log 保留一个普通诊断事件。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:239
msgid "Drain at most one numeric event into an ordinary logger."
msgstr "最多向普通 logger 排空一个数值事件。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:239
msgid ""
"Fixed-size formatting and one ring access; never loops until empty, reads a "
"clock, allocates, waits or calls a kernel API."
msgstr "固定大小格式化及一次 ring 访问；不循环到空，不读时钟、不分配、不等待，也不调用 kernel API。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:239
msgid "[inout] Exclusive retained consumer storage."
msgstr "[inout] 独占的保留消费者存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:239
msgid "[inout] Existing ring; no second queue is created."
msgstr "[inout] 既有 ring；不创建第二套队列。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:239
msgid "[inout] Task-only logger with an explicitly chosen sink."
msgstr "[inout] 仅 task 的 logger，使用显式选择的 sink。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:239
msgid "[in] Absolute deadline passed unchanged to Log."
msgstr "[in] 原样传给 Log 的绝对截止时间。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:239
msgid ""
"SUCCESS for one publication, EMPTY for no event, or actual ring/Log error "
"while preserving any pending event."
msgstr "发布一项时为 SUCCESS，无事件时为 EMPTY；或返回实际 ring/Log 错误并保留待处理事件。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:239
msgid "Caller-owned consumer slot; zero before first publication."
msgstr "调用方消费者槽位；首次发布前清零。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:239
msgid ""
"One task drains this slot and ring. Existing producer/ring lifetimes and "
"privilege domains remain unchanged. A failed log publication retains the "
"event for a later explicit call. Delivered counts accepted/filtered Log "
"records, not wire completion or durable storage. No fault context is "
"supported."
msgstr ""
"一个 task 排空此槽位及 ring。既有 producer/ring "
"存活期及特权域保持不变。日志发布失败时保留事件，等待后续显式调用。Delivered 统计被接受／过滤的 Log 记录，不表示线上完成或持久存储。不支持"
" fault 上下文。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:243
msgid "fault_record.h"
msgstr "fault_record.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:245
msgid "Fixed raw crash capture without a kernel."
msgstr "不调用 kernel 的固定 raw crash capture。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:245
msgid "Capture fixed facts before optional fault interpretation."
msgstr "在可选故障解释前捕获固定事实。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:245
msgid ""
"Fixed work in task/fault/ISR/masked context. No clock, heap, lock, log, "
"kernel, Flash or transport is called. First capture wins; nested capture "
"never overwrites it. Pointer provenance, a usable instruction/stack path and"
" physical retention cannot be established by this function."
msgstr ""
"在 task/fault/ISR/屏蔽上下文中执行固定工作量。不调用时钟、堆、锁、日志、kernel、Flash 或 "
"transport。首次捕获生效；嵌套捕获不覆盖。此函数不能证明指针来源、可用指令／栈路径或物理保留。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:245
msgid "[inout] Provenance-valid aligned retained CPU storage."
msgstr "[inout] 来源有效、对齐的保留 CPU 存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:245
msgid "[in] Stable readable numeric facts, disjoint from record."
msgstr "[in] 稳定可读数值事实，与 record 不重叠。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:245
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, or BUSY when a record/capture already exists."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID，或已有记录／捕获时的 BUSY。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:245
msgid "Validate and decode a quiescent retained record."
msgstr "校验并解码已静默的保留记录。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:245
msgid ""
"Task/startup fixed work; retains no pointer and changes no source bytes. "
"Unknown versions return UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "task/startup 固定工作量，不保留指针，不改源字节。未知版本返回 UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:245
msgid "[in] Aligned retained storage; no concurrent writer."
msgstr "[in] 对齐的保留存储；不允许并发写入者。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:245
msgid "[out] Separate destination, unchanged on failure."
msgstr "[out] 分离目标，失败时不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:245
msgid "SUCCESS, EMPTY for no commit, IO for corrupt data, INVALID."
msgstr "SUCCESS，无提交时为 EMPTY，数据损坏时为 IO，或 INVALID。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:245
msgid "Acknowledge one exact committed record in normal context."
msgstr "在普通上下文确认一条精确已提交记录。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:245
msgid ""
"Task/startup only. Clears commit, never resets hardware or establishes that "
"any persistent copy exists."
msgstr "仅 task/startup。清除 commit，不重置硬件，也不证明存在任何持久副本。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:245
msgid "[inout] Retained storage, serialized with readers/capture."
msgstr "[inout] 保留存储，与 reader/capture 串行执行。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:245
msgid "[in] Expected captured identity."
msgstr "[in] 预期捕获身份。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:245
msgid "SUCCESS, STATE for a different sequence, or read error."
msgstr "SUCCESS，sequence 不同时为 STATE，或读取错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:245
msgid "Combine already-latched reset bits with optional crash facts."
msgstr "组合已锁存 reset 位与可选崩溃事实。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:245
msgid "Startup/task only; no reset flags are read or cleared here."
msgstr "仅 startup/task；此处不读取或清除 reset flag。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:245
msgid "[in] Quiescent retained record."
msgstr "[in] 已静默的保留记录。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:245
msgid "[in] Existing nx_reset_cause result, unmodified."
msgstr "[in] 未修改的既有 nx_reset_cause 结果。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:245
msgid "[out] Separate output; unchanged for corrupt record."
msgstr "[out] 分离输出；记录损坏时不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:245
msgid "SUCCESS for valid or absent crash; otherwise read error."
msgstr "崩溃记录有效或缺失时为 SUCCESS；否则为读取错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:245
msgid "Explicit numeric facts; no pointer requires dereferencing on fault."
msgstr "显式数值事实；不含故障时需要解引用的指针字段。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:245
msgid "Aligned retained storage with explicit little-endian payload."
msgstr "对齐的保留存储，使用显式 little-endian payload。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:245
msgid ""
"The application reserves this storage outside startup zeroing and validates "
"the chip reset/retention domain. It remains live and CPU-accessible through "
"capture and reboot. The commit word is written last. CRC detects damage, "
"without authentication or a power-loss guarantee. Capture is one privileged "
"CPU/security domain; no DMA or concurrent host access is permitted. Startup "
"must not initialize a retained record before examining it."
msgstr ""
"应用在 startup 清零范围外预留此存储，并校验芯片 reset／保留域。该存储须在 capture 和 reboot 期间保持存活且可供 CPU "
"访问。commit word 最后写入。CRC 检测损坏，不提供认证或掉电保证。捕获限定于一个特权 CPU／安全域；不允许 DMA "
"或并发主机访问。startup 检查保留记录前不得初始化该记录。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:245
msgid "Boot reset facts remain independent from a previous crash record."
msgstr "boot reset 事实与此前崩溃记录保持独立。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:249
msgid "fault_m4.h"
msgstr "fault_m4.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:251
msgid "Bounded Cortex-M4F exception frame capture."
msgstr "有界 Cortex-M4F 异常帧捕获。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:251
msgid "Copy the core exception frame only within an explicit binding."
msgstr "仅在显式绑定范围内复制核心异常帧。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:251
msgid ""
"Fixed reads of the eight core words; verifies full basic or M4F extended-"
"frame space and optional xPSR alignment padding before publication. Core "
"words stay at raw SP; floating-point state follows them. Floating-point "
"registers are not copied. Does not inspect Kernel/TCB, read a clock, "
"allocate, print, change masks or touch fault-status MMIO. Caller supplies "
"any status words separately. This profile excludes TrustZone and non-M4F "
"exception layouts."
msgstr ""
"固定读取八个 core word；发布前验证完整 basic 或 M4F extended-frame 空间，以及可选 xPSR 对齐 "
"padding。core word 保持在 raw SP 位置，浮点状态位于其后。不复制浮点寄存器，不检查 Kernel／TCB、不读 "
"clock、不分配、打印、改 mask 或访问 fault-status MMIO。status word 由调用者另行提供。此 profile 排除 "
"TrustZone 和非 M4F 异常布局。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:251
msgid "[inout] Exclusive initialized facts; hardware fields updated."
msgstr "[inout] 独占已初始化 facts；更新硬件字段。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:251
msgid "[in] Raw F407 M4F EXC_RETURN from handler entry."
msgstr "[in] handler 入口的原始 F407 M4F EXC_RETURN。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:251
msgid "[in] Raw handler-entry MSP, before C prologue changes it."
msgstr "[in] handler 入口原始 MSP，早于 C prologue 的修改。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:251
msgid "[in] Raw PSP captured by that same assembly entry."
msgstr "[in] 同一汇编入口捕获的原始 PSP。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:251
msgid "[in] Original static MSP allocation."
msgstr "[in] 原始静态 MSP 分配。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:251
msgid "[in] Original interrupted PSP allocation, or NULL."
msgstr "[in] 原始被中断 PSP 分配，或 NULL。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:251
msgid ""
"SUCCESS with validity flags for an admitted basic/extended frame; INVALID "
"leaves facts unchanged for invalid arguments or unsupported EXC_RETURN. Out-"
"of-range frames retain raw SP/EXC_RETURN but clear CORE/STACK validity and "
"return SUCCESS."
msgstr ""
"basic/extended frame 获准入时返回 SUCCESS 及有效性 flag；参数无效或 EXC_RETURN 不支持时返回 "
"INVALID 且 facts 不变。frame 越界时保留原始 SP/EXC_RETURN，清除 CORE/STACK 有效性并返回 SUCCESS。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:251
msgid "Original CPU-readable static stack allocation, never a TCB."
msgstr "原始 CPU 可读静态栈分配，从不是 TCB。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:251
msgid ""
"The application supplies immutable original creation facts. Live storage and"
" exception frame remain unchanged during capture. Neither a private RTOS "
"layout nor a kernel query is used. A readable C pointer cannot be proven "
"from its number."
msgstr ""
"应用提供不可变的原始创建事实。捕获期间活存储及异常帧保持不变。不使用私有 RTOS 布局或 kernel 查询。不能仅从 C 指针的数值证明其可读。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:255
msgid "fault_storage.h"
msgstr "fault_storage.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:257
msgid "Normal-context persistence of one raw crash."
msgstr "在正常上下文持久化一个 raw crash。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:257
msgid "Persist a validated raw record before acknowledging retention."
msgstr "先持久化已校验原始记录，再确认保留源。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:257
msgid ""
"Privileged task/startup after storage initialization only; never call from "
"an exception. Uses existing whole-blob Storage, without reserving Flash, "
"formatting, retrying, changing schema or opening a database. An ambiguous "
"failed commit may already exist durably; consumers use sequence and build ID"
" for duplicate handling. Reopen Storage as required by its mutation-failure "
"contract before another attempt."
msgstr ""
"仅允许存储初始化后的特权 task/startup；从不在异常中调用。使用既有整 blob Storage，不预留 Flash、不格式化、不重试、不改 "
"schema，也不打开数据库。含糊的失败提交可能已持久存在；消费者使用 sequence 和 build ID 处理重复。再次尝试前，按 Storage"
" 修改失败合同要求重新打开 Storage。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:257
msgid "[inout] Retained source, exclusively owned through this call."
msgstr "[inout] 保留源，整个调用期间独占。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:257
msgid "[inout] Already-open exclusive product-selected Storage."
msgstr "[inout] 已打开、独占、由产品选定的 Storage。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:257
msgid ""
"OK after durable save and exact acknowledgement, NOT_FOUND for absent "
"retained record, CORRUPT for damaged capture, or original Storage failure. "
"Failure keeps the source committed."
msgstr ""
"持久保存并精确确认后为 OK；无保留记录为 NOT_FOUND，捕获损坏为 CORRUPT，或原始 Storage 失败。失败时源保持已提交。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:261
msgid "fault_m4_profile.h"
msgstr "fault_m4_profile.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:263
msgid "Explicit M4F exception owner and emergency stack."
msgstr "显式 M4F 异常 owner 与紧急 stack。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:263
msgid "Define exactly once at the selected image's composition site."
msgstr "在选定镜像的组合处恰好定义一次。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:263
msgid "Define a dedicated writable eight-byte-aligned stack top."
msgstr "定义独立、可写、8-byte 对齐的栈顶。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:263
msgid ""
"Assembly switches MSP here after recording original MSP/PSP. Its original "
"allocation, finite stack budget and exclusion from all normal users are "
"product composition requirements. A missing, zero or misaligned top never "
"enters the C handler."
msgstr ""
"汇编记录原始 MSP/PSP 后在此切换 MSP。其原始分配、有限栈预算及排除全部普通使用者，是产品组合要求。栈顶缺失、为零或未对齐时，从不进入 C "
"handler。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:263
msgid "One immutable image-specific capture composition."
msgstr "不可变、镜像专用的单一捕获组合。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:263
msgid ""
"The product reserves retained record and a dedicated emergency stack, "
"supplies identity/sequence facts, and keeps every original static task "
"allocation readable through capture. Task bindings are original allocations,"
" not live TCB pointers or a kernel registry. Their count is the explicit "
"scan budget. Optional after_capture runs only after successful raw commit; "
"it must be bounded and must not use ordinary Log/RTT/Kernel, allocate, "
"release loans or change masks. Returning still parks. Recovery/reset/safe "
"outputs belong to the external product."
msgstr ""
"产品预留保留记录及独立应急栈，提供 identity/sequence 事实，并使每份原始静态任务分配在 capture 期间保持可读。task "
"绑定是原始分配，不是 live TCB 指针或 kernel 注册表。其数量是显式扫描预算。可选 after_capture "
"仅在原始提交成功后运行；必须有界，不得使用普通 Log/RTT/Kernel、分配、释放借用或改变 "
"mask。即使返回也仍停驻。恢复／reset／安全输出由外部产品负责。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:267
msgid "cm_backtrace_adapter.h"
msgstr "cm_backtrace_adapter.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:269
msgid "CmBacktrace with explicit retained stack bounds."
msgstr "使用显式保留 stack 边界的 CmBacktrace。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:269
msgid "Initialize upstream linker bounds before faults are possible."
msgstr "在可能发生 fault 前初始化上游 linker 边界。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:269
msgid ""
"Explicit F407/Cortex-M4 target only, single privileged startup owner. Uses "
"current generated MSP and live-Flash linker bounds. No vendor handler, OS "
"platform, printer, kernel query or task registry is installed. Default "
"physical exception ownership remains with the selected startup composition."
msgstr ""
"仅显式 F407/Cortex-M4 target，由一个特权 startup owner 执行。使用当前生成的 MSP 和 live-Flash "
"linker 边界。不安装供应商 handler、OS platform、printer、kernel 查询或 task "
"注册表。默认物理异常所有权仍归选定 startup 组合。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:269
msgid "[in] Valid immutable firmware name, at most 32 characters."
msgstr "[in] 有效不可变固件名，最多 32 characters。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:269
msgid "[in] Valid immutable hardware version, at most 32 characters."
msgstr "[in] 有效不可变硬件版本，最多 32 characters。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:269
msgid "[in] Valid immutable software version, at most 32 characters."
msgstr "[in] 有效不可变软件版本，最多 32 characters。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:269
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, CONTEXT or STATE for repeated initialization."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、CONTEXT，重复初始化时为 STATE。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:269
msgid "Run the actual upstream stack scan over one proven live span."
msgstr "在一份已证明存活的范围上运行真实上游栈扫描。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:269
msgid ""
"Best-effort same-boot diagnosis after raw capture. Skips the admitted "
"basic/extended M4F frame and alignment word, then calls unmodified "
"cm_backtrace_call_stack_any. Full declared scan range may be read even when "
"address capacity is reached. PSP uses explicit original binding, never "
"FreeRTOS TCB offsets. A reset does not preserve the stack allocation "
"contents; use the raw register record/host decoder after reboot instead. No "
"ordinary Log, RTT, kernel, Flash or clock is used. This selected code range "
"excludes RAM-executed functions."
msgstr ""
"在原始捕获后进行尽力而为的同次启动诊断。跳过获准入的 basic/extended M4F frame 及对齐 word，然后调用未修改的 "
"cm_backtrace_call_stack_any。即使地址容量已满，仍可能读取整个声明扫描范围。PSP 使用显式原始绑定，从不使用 "
"FreeRTOS TCB 偏移。reset 不保留栈分配内容；重启后改用原始寄存器记录／主机 decoder。不使用普通 "
"Log、RTT、kernel、Flash 或时钟。选定代码范围不含 RAM 执行函数。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:269
msgid "[in] Previously committed validated M4F crash record."
msgstr "[in] 此前已提交且已校验的 M4F 崩溃记录。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:269
msgid "[in] Original still-readable interrupted MSP/PSP stack."
msgstr "[in] 原始且仍可读的被中断 MSP/PSP 栈。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:269
msgid "[out] Exclusive output, disjoint from all input storage."
msgstr "[out] 独占输出，与所有输入存储不重叠。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:269
msgid "[in] Positive address count, at most 32."
msgstr "[in] 正地址数量，最多 32。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:269
msgid "[in] Explicit scan budget, one through 1024."
msgstr "[in] 显式扫描预算，1 至 1024。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:269
msgid "[out] Separate output count, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 分离的输出数量，拒绝时不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:269
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, STATE or raw-record validation error."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、STATE 或原始记录校验错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:273
msgid "rtt.h"
msgstr "rtt.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:275
msgid "Whole-record nonblocking SEGGER RTT channels."
msgstr "整记录非阻塞 SEGGER RTT channel。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:275
msgid "Configure caller buffers with upstream nonblocking SKIP mode."
msgstr "以上游非阻塞 SKIP 模式配置调用方 buffer。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:275
msgid ""
"This explicit initialization is never run for unselected inventory. The "
"upstream control block is initialized once. Direct calls to vendor RTT APIs "
"are outside this adapter's serialization domain and must not coexist with "
"it."
msgstr ""
"未选择的库存从不执行此显式初始化。上游 control block 初始化一次。直接调用供应商 RTT API 位于适配器串行化域之外，不得与其并存。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:275
msgid "[inout] Zeroed unpublished object, not already initialized."
msgstr "[inout] 清零、未发布且尚未初始化的对象。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:275
msgid ""
"[in] Explicit channel index, one through three. Upstream channel zero "
"remains its compile-time housekeeping channel."
msgstr "[in] 显式 channel 索引，1 至 3。上游 channel 0 仍为编译期 housekeeping channel。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:275
msgid "[in] Immutable NUL-terminated static channel name."
msgstr "[in] 不可变 NUL 结尾的静态 channel 名。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:275
msgid "[out] Exclusive caller-owned target-to-host ring storage."
msgstr "[out] 独占调用方 target-to-host ring 存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:275
msgid "[in] At least two bytes, at most UINT_MAX."
msgstr "[in] 至少 2 bytes，最多 UINT_MAX。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:275
msgid "[out] Exclusive caller-owned host-to-target ring storage."
msgstr "[out] 独占调用方 host-to-target ring 存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:275
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, STATE, CONTEXT or nonblocking BUSY."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、STATE、CONTEXT 或非阻塞 BUSY。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:275
msgid "Return the existing Log port for complete SKIP records."
msgstr "返回完整 SKIP 记录使用的既有 Log 端口。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:275
msgid ""
"No partial write reports success. Full/no-host buffers return OVERFLOW "
"without waiting or overwriting older data. flush reports BUSY until the host"
" consumed the ring; it never waits and does not prove durable capture. Fault"
" use is prohibited."
msgstr ""
"部分写入不报告成功。buffer 满／无 host 时返回 OVERFLOW，不等待，也不覆盖旧数据。flush 在 host 消费 ring 前报告 "
"BUSY；不等待，也不证明持久捕获。禁止 fault 使用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:275
msgid "[inout] Initialized channel, retained through publisher join."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化 channel，保留到发布者退出会合。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:275
msgid "Existing synchronous sink interface, or empty for NULL."
msgstr "既有同步 sink 接口；NULL 返回空接口。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:275
msgid "Copy available host bytes once, with no polling loop."
msgstr "一次复制可用 host 字节，不使用轮询循环。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:275
msgid "No kernel API, clock, wait, allocation or hidden executor."
msgstr "不调用 kernel API，不读时钟、不等待、不分配，也没有隐藏 executor。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:275
msgid "[inout] Live task-owned channel."
msgstr "[inout] 活跃、由 task 拥有的 channel。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:275
msgid "[out] Separate destination released on return."
msgstr "[out] 分离目标，返回时解除借用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:275
msgid "[in] Destination bytes, at most UINT_MAX."
msgstr "[in] 目标字节数，最多 UINT_MAX。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:275
msgid "[out] Copied bytes; zero for EMPTY."
msgstr "[out] 已复制字节数；EMPTY 时为零。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:275
msgid "SUCCESS, EMPTY, BUSY, INVALID, CONTEXT or STATE."
msgstr "SUCCESS、EMPTY、BUSY、INVALID、CONTEXT 或 STATE。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:275
msgid "Close target admission without overwriting pending host data."
msgstr "关闭 target 准入，不覆盖待处理 host 数据。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:275
msgid ""
"SUCCESS proves local closure and consumed uplink, not host join. The "
"upstream control block still refers to ring/name storage. Retain it for the "
"image/debugger lifetime; debugger detachment remains external."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS 证明本地关闭及 uplink 已消费，不证明 host 已退出。上游 control block 仍引用 ring/name "
"存储。须在镜像／debugger 存活期内保留；debugger 分离仍由外部负责。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:275
msgid "[inout] Unique task owner after other publishers have joined."
msgstr "[inout] 其他发布者退出后的唯一 task owner。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:275
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY while host data remains, or context/state error."
msgstr "SUCCESS，仍有 host 数据时为 BUSY，或上下文／状态错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:275
msgid "Explicit channel storage and saturating record statistics."
msgstr "显式 channel 存储及饱和记录统计。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:275
msgid ""
"One immutable channel assignment per object; caller owns its name, up/down "
"buffers and lifetime. Channel uniqueness is a composition contract. Target "
"calls are task-only, privileged on one CPU/security domain. An atomic try-"
"guard serializes the pinned upstream without OS locks or mask changes. Host "
"debugger access follows the unchanged upstream protocol."
msgstr ""
"每个对象绑定一个不可变 channel；调用方拥有其 name、up/down buffer 及存活期。channel "
"唯一性由组合合同保证。target 调用仅限 task，在一个 CPU／安全域中具备特权。atomic try-guard 串行化锁定上游，不使用 OS"
" 锁或修改 mask。host debugger 访问遵循不变的上游协议。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:279
msgid "shell.h"
msgstr "shell.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:281
msgid "Read-only letter-shell with task-owned execution."
msgstr "由 task 拥有执行进度的只读 letter-shell。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:281
msgid "Exact backend layout is available only in shell_storage.h."
msgstr "精确 backend 布局仅在 shell_storage.h 中公开。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:281
msgid "Initialize exact backend storage and caller line/history bytes."
msgstr "初始化精确 backend 存储及调用方 line/history 字节。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:281
msgid ""
"Uses the actual pinned letter-shell parser with a fixed read-only command "
"table: help, version, health, fault, reset and resources. reset only reports"
" captured causes. No variable writes, address execution, maintenance "
"commands, allocation, task creation or product authentication is added. The "
"selected upstream profile supports one live shell; its transient callback "
"context is serialized without an OS lock."
msgstr ""
"使用真实锁定 letter-shell parser 及固定只读命令表：help、version、health、fault、reset 和 "
"resources。reset 仅报告已捕获的原因。不增加变量写入、地址执行、维护命令、分配、task 创建或产品认证。选定上游 profile "
"仅支持一个 live shell；其临时 callback context 通过无 OS lock 的串行化管理。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:281
msgid "[inout] Unused zeroed shell_storage.h object, not already live."
msgstr "[inout] 未使用、已清零的 shell_storage.h 对象，尚未 live。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:281
msgid "[in] Copied synchronous task transport."
msgstr "[in] 复制的同步 task transport。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:281
msgid "[out] Exclusive line/history storage through stop."
msgstr "[out] 独占 line/history 存储，保留到 stop。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:281
msgid "[in] At least 64 bytes, at most UINT16_MAX."
msgstr "[in] 至少 64 bytes，最多 UINT16_MAX。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:281
msgid "[in] Stable diagnostic sources kept through stop."
msgstr "[in] 稳定诊断源，保留到 stop。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:281
msgid "[in] Absolute output deadline for the initial prompt."
msgstr "[in] 初始 prompt 的绝对输出截止时间。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:281
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, BUSY for concurrent/global backend entry, INVALID, CONTEXT or "
"transport error."
msgstr "SUCCESS，并发／全局 backend 进入时为 BUSY，或 INVALID、CONTEXT、transport 错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:281
msgid "Read and process at most one character in the owning task."
msgstr "在 owner task 中最多读取并处理一个字符。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:281
msgid ""
"A newline invokes a read-only command synchronously. Never call from an ISR,"
" trace hook or fault; no busy input loop, implicit scheduling, kernel call "
"or automatic retry occurs."
msgstr ""
"换行同步调用只读命令。从不在 ISR、trace hook 或 fault 中调用；不忙循环输入，不隐式调度，不调用 kernel，也不自动重试。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:281
msgid "[inout] Live instance, exclusively owned by this task."
msgstr "[inout] 活跃实例，由此 task 独占。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:281
msgid "[in] Absolute output deadline, passed unchanged."
msgstr "[in] 原样传递的绝对输出截止时间。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:281
msgid "SUCCESS, EMPTY, BUSY, CONTEXT, STATE, or transport error."
msgstr "SUCCESS、EMPTY、BUSY、CONTEXT、STATE 或 transport 错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:281
msgid "Detach the idle backend after publishers/consumers have joined."
msgstr "发布者／消费者退出会合后，分离空闲 backend。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:281
msgid "No transport shutdown or storage reclamation is performed."
msgstr "不关闭 transport 或回收存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:281
msgid "[inout] Unique task execution owner."
msgstr "[inout] 唯一 task 执行 owner。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:281
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY during an entry, INVALID or CONTEXT."
msgstr "SUCCESS，进入期间为 BUSY，或 INVALID、CONTEXT。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:281
msgid "Explicit synchronous byte transport; no device is discovered."
msgstr "显式同步字节 transport；不发现设备。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:281
msgid ""
"read copies at most capacity bytes; EMPTY means no data. write returns only "
"after releasing its source bytes, including failure. Both run in the calling"
" task. Implementations must return in their declared finite budget; no shell"
" worker is created. ISR/DMA publishers only fill their own RX storage."
msgstr ""
"read 最多复制 capacity 字节；EMPTY 表示无数据。write 仅在解除其源字节借用后返回，包括失败情况。两者均在调用 task "
"中运行。实现必须在声明的有限预算内返回；不创建 shell worker。ISR/DMA 发布者只填充自己的 RX 存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:281
msgid "Stable caller-owned diagnostics, read only during execution."
msgstr "稳定的调用方诊断，仅在执行期间读取。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:281
msgid ""
"The caller serializes publication with shell execution. These are value "
"snapshots, never live request/provider pointers. Missing values print "
"unknown. Version is a valid immutable NUL-terminated string no longer than "
"80 bytes."
msgstr ""
"调用方将发布与 shell 执行串行化。这些是值快照，从不是活跃 request/provider 指针。缺失值打印 unknown。Version "
"是有效不可变 NUL 结尾字符串，长度不超过 80 bytes。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:285
msgid "shell_storage.h"
msgstr "shell_storage.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:287
msgid "Exact pinned letter-shell composition storage."
msgstr "精确锁定的 letter-shell 装配存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:287
msgid "Caller-owned backend; include only where storage is composed."
msgstr "调用方 backend；仅在组合存储处 include。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/services.md:287
msgid ""
"Nexus::ShellStorage exposes the exact selected upstream profile, avoiding a "
"guessed maximum-size opaque allocation. Fields are private implementation "
"state, not product APIs."
msgstr ""
"Nexus::ShellStorage 公开精确选定的上游 profile，避免猜测最大不透明分配大小。字段是私有实现状态，不是产品 API。"
